{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dual Eclipse</strong></i> is a <strong>shortform trick-taking RPG</strong>\u00a0about restoring order to the cosmos by seeking out and defeating a Prismatic Dragon that is attempting to consume the Moon and Sun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of three classes to explore mysterious dungeons, evade dangerous traps, uncover powerful treasure, and discover secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE TRICK-TAKING COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/09dd2bc23102bef91ccc77849a935b8c.poster.avif?t=1757693125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/09dd2bc23102bef91ccc77849a935b8c.webm?t=1757693125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/09dd2bc23102bef91ccc77849a935b8c.mp4?t=1757693125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snappy trick-taking combat!</strong> Think of it like fencing with cards!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry cards!</strong> A tactical choice that offers high risk, high reward opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your cards are your equipment!\u00a0</strong>Card don't just have effects, they're how you fight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique combos</strong> encourage interesting choices and dynamic combat.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR DECK, CRAFT CARDS, AND GROW STRONGER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/6b476163f41f85a20501c6adad107c93.poster.avif?t=1757693125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/6b476163f41f85a20501c6adad107c93.webm?t=1757693125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048300/extras/6b476163f41f85a20501c6adad107c93.mp4?t=1757693125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Loot cards </strong> by defeating enemies and finding treasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft cards</strong> that empower your build. Need a shield to go with that sword? Craft it!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Level up</strong>\u00a0and specialize your class! Make your defense your best offense as the Paladin, specialize in bows as the Rogue, or command frost as the Wizard!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Boulder Fist ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048300/41d8e8bbd917591c90a86ed8655986ec55d0870f.jpg"},{"name":"War Machine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048300/c8ccb253cc84caf9225e2255dedf5f042f2db2e3.jpg"},{"name":"Rogue Class","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048300/a27975e340e79ecf15fc11c7c14506a96b1950f1.jpg"},{"name":"Paladin Class","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048300/ea92517851c3c86867f1c0dfc34f5a52828b8299.jpg"},{"name":"Wizard Class","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048300/d3d9e4e1ed4134e89b3c778c321faaf4958f7e16.jpg"},{"name":"Stone of Strength","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3048300/f66e100d75c46ac1fe900539dbc1552626698da2.jpg"},{"name":"Stone of Agi